---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms of service and retainer agreements for DermaArc (dermaarc.com)."
>
  <section class="section-lg">
    <div class="container-text">
      <div class="mb-10">
        <span class="badge-accent mb-4 inline-block">Legal</span>
        <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-ink mb-4" style="font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px); line-height: 1.1;">
          Terms of Service
        </h1>
        <p class="text-text-muted font-body text-sm">Last updated: October 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-text-muted font-body text-base leading-relaxed">
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-ink text-2xl mb-3">1. Retainer & Engagement Terms</h2>
          <p>
            DermaArc operates on a month-to-month retainer of ₹30,000 + applicable taxes. There are no lock-in annual contracts. You may cancel your retainer at the end of any billing cycle with 14 days written notice.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-ink text-2xl mb-3">2. Ad Spend & Third-Party Platforms</h2>
          <p>
            Advertising budgets (recommended ₹100–150/day to start) are paid directly to advertising platforms (Meta Ads, Google Ads) via the clinic's own payment method. DermaArc does not markup ad spend.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-ink text-2xl mb-3">3. Medical Advertising & NMC Compliance</h2>
          <p>
            All marketing collateral, Reel scripts, and landing pages created by DermaArc are designed in adherence with National Medical Commission (NMC) guidelines and medical ethics codes. The clinic retains final review and approval before any public posting.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-ink text-2xl mb-3">4. Ownership of Assets</h2>
          <p>
            All procedure funnels, creative assets, Google profiles, and ad accounts set up during the engagement remain 100% the property of the clinic.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

